      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我想说话，但是我的身体很热很热。我身体里有了一个新的东西，名字叫“乐园”。",
      "traditional": "我想說話，但是我的身體很熱很熱。我身體裡有了一個新的東西，名字叫“樂園”。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng shuō huà dàn shì wǒ de shēn tǐ hěn rè hěn rè wǒ shēn tǐ lǐ yǒu le yí ge xīn de dōng xi míng zi jiào lè yuán",
      "english": "I wanted to speak, but my body was very, very hot. There was something new inside my body. It was called “paradise”."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我想关了“乐园”，但是不可以。我看见苹果身体里也有了“乐园”。",
      "traditional": "我想關了“樂園”，但是不可以。我看見蘋果身體裡也有了“樂園”。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng guān le lè yuán dàn shì bù kě yǐ wǒ kàn jiàn píng guǒ shēn tǐ lǐ yě yǒu le lè yuán",
      "english": "I wanted to turn off “paradise”, but I couldn’t. I saw that paradise was also inside Apple’s body."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "电视里、电脑里、VR眼镜里都有了“乐园”。",
      "traditional": "電視裡、電腦裡、VR眼鏡裡都有了“樂園”。",
      "pinyin": "diàn shì lǐ diàn nǎo lǐ 1 yǎn jìng lǐ dōu yǒu le lè yuán",
      "english": "“Paradise” was inside the TV, inside the computer, and inside the VR glasses."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "爸爸来了，他在“乐园”里有了一个书店，他坐在书店里看书；",
      "traditional": "爸爸來了，他在“樂園”裡有了一個書店，他坐在書店裡看書；",
