      "english": "Dad came. He had a bookstore in “paradise”. He sat in the bookstore and read."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妈妈来了，她在“乐园”里去了北京；",
      "traditional": "媽媽來了，她在“樂園”裡去了北京；",
      "pinyin": "mā ma lái le tā zài lè yuán lǐ qù le běi jīng",
      "english": "Mom came. She went to Beijing in “paradise”."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "大星来了，大星女朋友也来了，他们在“乐园”里有了三个Pikachu。",
