    "sentence_translations": [
      "(18) “Paradise” Is Here",
      "",
      "Today? Now?! Chacha said that he must become the master of this world now.",
      "",
      "I wanted to speak, but my body was very, very hot. There was something new inside my body. It was called “paradise”.",
      "",
      "I wanted to turn off “paradise”, but I couldn’t. I saw that paradise was also inside Apple’s body.",
      "“Paradise” was inside the TV, inside the computer, and inside the VR glasses.",
      "",
      "Dad came. He had a bookstore in “paradise”. He sat in the bookstore and read.",
      "Mom came. She went to Beijing in “paradise”.",
      "Daxing came. Daxing’s girlfriend also came. They had three Pikachus in “paradise”.",
      "",
      "They sat there and did not sleep. The coffee robot made coffee.",
      "They drank a cup; they drank three cups; they drank many cups ..."
    ]
